better-auth (docs structural components)
----------------------------------------
Portions of the application shell — the header tab strip, the docs sidebar,
the changelog layout, and the docs page inset — were adapted from the
better-auth documentation application:

  https://github.com/better-auth/better-auth

Upstream paths:
