The MIT grant covers that software and associated documentation files.
Their brand assets, marketing copy, Trusted By lists, Ask AI widget, and
sign-in demos were not copied. OKModel content and the OKModel wordmark
are original to this project.

The sidebar is driven by the Fumadocs page tree rather than a hand-written
contents array, so meta.json stays the only source of navigation truth.
The changelog is parsed from the committed root changelog.md rather than
fetched from the GitHub releases API, so the site build is deterministic
and builds with no network.

